<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alza Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alza Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded Alza Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- set a one-year price target of $39 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Alza shares are poised for &quot;substantial&quot; upside appreciation.</p>
<p>-- Alza lost 5/8 to 30-1/4.</p>
</text>
